/*
workspaceMount
--------------

Defines how the workspace is mounted inside the container.

• Customize the mount’s source, target, and options.
• Useful when you need a different host path or specific mount flags.

If omitted, the local workspace folder is mounted to `workspaceFolder`
using the default settings.
*/

{
  "name": "1_20-spec_workspaceMount",
  "image": "ubuntu:latest",
  "workspaceMount": "source=${localWorkspaceFolder},target=/workspace,type=bind,consistency=cached"
}